Subject: Cantor Phase3 Topology Acquisition Lineage Forms Justification

& [JustificationIdentity] is exact
  + [justification_uuid] is 5e3ea2ef-f661-43e6-ae1a-0a223bf9619f
  + [source_snapshot_uuid] is 6fffb113-5add-4910-970a-08ad7b82f0ec
  + [protocol_uuid] is aad1eb00-c43a-40a9-baca-dc75fbe25a6d
  + [requirements] are P3TALF-001 through P3TALF-014
  + [state] is justified_unsigned

& [Need] is govern the representation seam before physical scanner code
  + current scanner formation requires two distinct complete acquisition lineages, exact causal order, common scope, independent carriers, and Equal reconciliation
  + current pure carrier modules can validate ancestry and equality but cannot identify acquisition events or physical origin
  + direct M2C code would otherwise invent identity, scope, role, order, construction authority, result provenance, and faults while adding effects
  + a pure signed contract can settle those meanings before any Windows observation is selected

& [WhyClaimForms] is necessary
  + inspectable caller-authored data is required for deterministic tests, audit, serialization, and later producer integration
  + caller construction cannot prove acquisition occurrence, producer identity, causal truth, or physical origin
  + ClaimForm and ValidClaim names preserve useful pure reasoning without authority inflation
  + exact strict serde makes statements inspectable while output-only construction prevents arbitrary replay as a derived result

& [WhyLogicalIdentity] is bounded
  + nonzero u64 provides canonical finite correlation, equality, inequality, and round-trip stability
  + no string parser, UUID generator, clock, randomness, registry, or global state is needed
  + syntax explicitly proves neither uniqueness nor occurrence
  + later M2C retains producer binding and collision-domain responsibility

& [WhyCompleteStructuralScope] is mandatory
  + comparison is meaningful only when every root, profile, encoding, limit, policy, and predecessor coordinate agrees
  + a separate scope identifier could be copied while coordinates diverge
  + structural equality fails closed on every missing or unequal coordinate
  + no wildcard, default, optional field, or partial comparison can silently broaden evidence

& [WhyOwnedCarrierLineage] is necessary
  + current ordered digest carrier already owns its complete assembly and transitive supplied ancestry
  + retaining that carrier permits current independent revalidation and rederivation
  + a peer assembly copy creates two sources of truth and is therefore rejected
  + bare digest, locator, key, or summary loses ancestry and cannot enter the contract

& [WhyExplicitClockFreeOrder] is sufficient
  + first-completion-before-second-start is the exact semantic edge required by current formation
  + binding both endpoint identities denies field-order, operand-order, or numeric-order inference
  + a pure claim can validate coherence without pretending to witness time
  + clock domain, observation, and producer control-flow proof remain separate M2C decisions

& [WhyClaimOnlyOutput] is security relevant
  + current Equal is necessary for repeated inventory equality but proves no acquisition, order, quiescence, snapshot, freshness, or current state
  + an output-only result records that the declared pure conjunction passed current rederivation
  + explicit ClaimOnly provenance prevents the result from being read as issued evidence
  + absent admitted-lineage, issuer, receipt-conversion, and consumer types block upward authority conversion

& [WhyProductionAdmissionIsDeferred] is deliberate
  + private Rust fields alone are not a physical capability
  + a safe producer boundary must be shaped by actual Windows observation, producer identity, collision policy, and causal control flow
  + those surfaces are not authorized by this source and cannot be guessed for implementation convenience
  + complete absence is narrower and safer than an unaudited placeholder token or constructor

& [AlternativesRejected] are complete
  + implement M2C directly is rejected because representation and authority would be invented inside effect code
  + treat supplied carriers as observations is rejected because their origin is caller supplied
  + compare bare digests is rejected because scope and ancestry disappear
  + infer order from JSON, field, operand, or identity order is rejected because none witnesses causality
  + deserialize output or add a public constructor is rejected because caller data could impersonate derived result
  + define admitted provenance now is rejected because producer authority and physical evidence are absent
  + add clocks, ledgers, secrets, keys, persistence, or stronger evidence is rejected as unsupported growth

& [RiskReduction] is measurable
  + fourteen requirements and twenty-four constraints fix every role and forbidden inference
  + fourteen threat probes demonstrate no pure promotion path to physical provenance
  + seven folds converge on exact ownership, atomic faults, bounded resources, and zero effects
  + implementation candidate remains one safe pure module, one export, existing dependencies, and no Cargo drift

& [Cost] is bounded
  + finite governance records and later one bounded pure module if exact signature is issued
  + exactly two lineages and current inherited carrier bounds
  + zero platform, filesystem, clock, producer, issuer, consumer, persistence, or external-state surface
  + rollback before implementation removes only derived authority records while preserving the source

& [Decision] is justified
  + complete registry, matrix, build slice, canonical, artifact phase lock, and satisfaction signature before code
  + grant no implementation until artifact-bound canonical closure
  + grant no M2C, physical, issuer, consumer, or effect authority through this profile
